; Part of millgui. MIT licence, see millgui/LICENSE.
; FIND top face (millgui's TOP). The probe starts above the surface, within
; #3020 of it, and touches straight down once (o<millgui_top>: fast touch,
; back off #3021, slow touch). The surface Z (tip bottom by the tool length
; offset, in the coordinates before any write) is reported as
; z_minus_probed_position / #1009. With #3030 = 0 the active work offset's
; Z is set so that the surface reads Z0; X and Y are not written. Ends
; #3021 above the surface (Z = #3021 after a write), with the modal state
; as it was.
o<probe_z_minus_wco> sub
o10 if [#<_task> EQ 0]
    o<probe_z_minus_wco> return
o10 endif
o<millgui_probe_ready> call
M73
M50 P0
G90 G94
o<millgui_top> call [#3020]
o20 if [#3030 EQ 0]
    G10 L20 P0 Z[#5422 - #<_millgui_top>]
o20 endif
o<probe_z_minus_wco> endsub
M2
